Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.65,0:14:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,(泰国 曼谷)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.63,0:50:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,(我知道谁是麻雀账号的主人)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.43,0:50:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,(你不会喜欢这个名字的)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.72,0:50:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,(你什么时候给过我喜欢的消息?)
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.32,1:27:53.08,Default,,0,0,9,,《金蝉脱壳2：冥府》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.64,0:01:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.95,0:01:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,快说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.14,0:01:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,最后通牒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the last time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.42,0:01:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,从巴黎监狱释放阿卜杜勒·萨尔曼·阿尔-阿尔坎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}release Abdel Salman al-Arkan from his prison in Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.54,0:01:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我是卢卡斯·格雷夫斯 IDP报社 声明完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Lucas Graves, IDP News, signing off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.55,0:01:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你们 他们会杀了我们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. They're gonna kill us all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.22,0:02:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,放了他 不然45分钟后直播行刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release him, or the execution plays live in 45 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.67,0:02:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会杀了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna kill us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.48,0:02:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,坚强点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.69,0:02:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,目标确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destination confirmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.42,0:02:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该杀了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should kill them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.89,0:02:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,作出强势声明 西方人杀了自己人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A powerful statement, a Westerner killing his own people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.27,0:02:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,重新计算路径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recalculating route.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.72,0:02:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他们早该打电话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They should have called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他们应该早打电话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They should have called already!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.42,0:03:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No. No, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.74,0:03:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,求你别杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't kill me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.74,0:04:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.70,0:04:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快走 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Move. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.01,0:04:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要逃走了 快追 快追\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're getting away! Let's go! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.40,0:04:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我去检查北边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take the north side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,继续搜索南边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep searching the south side{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.75,0:05:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,封锁周围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock down the perimeter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的 他不在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit. He's not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.47,0:06:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,快让他们上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them on the truck now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.59,0:06:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.28,0:06:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,金布拉还没到 他拿着钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kimbral's not here. He's got the keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.23,0:06:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.98,0:06:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.39,0:06:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该走了 树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to go, Shu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊 快啊 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,金布拉究竟在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell's Kimbral?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.11,0:06:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你迟到了40秒 金布拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are 40 seconds late, Kimbral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.91,0:06:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,走 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.58,0:06:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你究竟跑哪儿去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.06,0:07:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她中枪了 - 让开地方 让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's been shot. - Give me room. Give me room!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.06,0:07:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝 爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice. Alice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.85,0:07:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,快醒啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.38,0:07:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,艾比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.04,0:07:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,让开 让开 让开 怎么啦？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, move, move, move, move. What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她胸口中枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's shot in the chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事用这么长时间？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell took you guys so long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit. Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.50,0:07:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.05,0:07:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.67,0:07:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.95,0:07:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这都怪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.02,0:07:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,到底出了什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,出了什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.42,0:08:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我有机会炸了他们的武器库 我就去炸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a chance to blow their weapons load, and I took it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他妈的计划里没有这个内容 - 我自己加的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It wasn't part of the fucking plan! - I factored it in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你自己加的？- 我的路线 速度…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, you factored it in? - The route I took, the speed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你刚才在哪儿？- 你是不是用了你的计算机程序？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where were you? - Did you use your computer program?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.14,0:08:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,树 根本没有可能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shu, there was less than point zero zero...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.67,0:08:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,树 算法非常可靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shu, the algorithm was solid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.58,0:08:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你损失了一名人质？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lost a hostage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.52,0:08:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,老板要生气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bossman's gonna be pissed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:08:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,快他妈带我们离开这儿 哈什\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get us the fuck out of here, Hush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.07,0:09:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要见我？- 是的 进来坐下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You wanted to see me? - Yeah. Come on in and sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.44,0:09:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让你走人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm letting you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.82,0:09:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我要让你走人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - l'm letting you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.40,0:09:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我不再需要你执行任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't be needing your services anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.17,0:09:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 这项工作中最重要的要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, the most important thing in this job{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是知道你能够相信身边的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is knowing you can trust the guy next to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.79,0:10:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前告诉过你 你的这个程序还未就绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you before. This program of yours, it wasn't ready,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.83,0:10:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你藐视团队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you defied the team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的程序未就绪 还是你根本就不喜欢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My program's not ready, or you just don't like it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,死了一个人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A woman died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.90,0:10:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不用这个算法也可能会死人 别都怪在我头上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could've happened without the algorithm. Don't you put that on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你的脑子就在想找些借口"算法"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to make all these excuses up in your head: algorithm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不管什么原因 有人死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it is, someone died{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.49,0:10:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你相信计算机而不是你的团队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you trusted a computer more than your own team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.17,0:10:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你说过我们扩张太快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Told you we expanded too fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你是打算坐在那训我还是回去工作？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna sit there and bust my balls or get back to work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.73,0:10:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,下次我会听你的… 也许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time, I'll listen to you... maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说 "我太蠢了"？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you say, quote, "I am stupid"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太彪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.28,0:10:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么想学青岛话？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you want to learn Qingdao?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:11:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,西方人是几乎不可能听懂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's almost impossible for a Westernear to decipher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like the impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.31,0:11:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这个游戏 围棋 很有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This game, Go, is interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.51,0:11:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得为什么总是你赢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you think you win all the time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.97,0:11:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我从四岁开始就下围棋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I've been playing Go since I was four,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.27,0:11:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,而你两年前才开始学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you started two years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.31,0:11:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,每一步棋都相互联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You move everything together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.77,0:11:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,每一领地都属于一个整体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take the territory as one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.86,0:11:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你吃掉我整块的棋子 所有的一切都当成一个整体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take my pieces as one. Everything flows as one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,而你们在处理绑架案的时候 没人做到整体配合行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you were at the factory, none of your guys moved together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.47,0:11:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没有形成一个整体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't flow as one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.12,0:11:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,金布拉想要抢你的风头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kimbral was trying to upstage you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.77,0:11:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我该单枪匹马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I should work alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.86,0:11:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人能单枪匹马做事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one does it alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我在执行任务的时候 脑子里听到的就是你这个声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess that's why I hear your voice in my head when I am on the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.56,0:11:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,可能听起来像我 但我认为那声音是你的直觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may sound like me, but I think that voice is your intuition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.39,0:11:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你好好考虑考虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take all the time you need,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.56,0:11:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但等你回来的时候 我希望你具备团队精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but when you come back, I need you to be a team player.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:11:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,别像金布拉那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be like Kimbral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.23,0:12:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,别混淆直觉和自负\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't confuse intuition with ego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.47,0:12:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 树 永远倾听你的直觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me on this one, Shu. Always listen to your intuition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.41,0:12:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,最初的通信卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The original communication satellite{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.55,0:12:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,最初的通信卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The original communication satellite{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,只能解决一个问题…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}set out to solve one problem...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.57,0:12:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就是如何将信号成功地经过弯曲的地球球面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how to send a signal successfully around the bend in the Earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.10,0:12:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,传递给接收方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and reach the receiver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.99,0:12:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,今天 我们雨声技术公司很荣幸地为您呈现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today, we at Yusheng Technology are proud to present to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.99,0:12:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,卫星技术的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the future of satellite tech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们速度更快 体积更小…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do it faster, with smaller units...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.88,0:12:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是投影会发生变化的地方？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now this is where the graphics are gonna change?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.32,0:12:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经说过我不需要投影了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need graphics!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.85,0:12:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是太阳马戏团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't Cirque de Soleil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我说到卫星的时候 你要让老虎跳出来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe a tiger can jump out when I get to the cubesats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.01,0:12:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,秦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:12:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以帮我解释吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little help here please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.09,0:13:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么啦？我喜欢老虎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? I like tigers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.99,0:13:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 大家听着 我们重新设置 五分钟后再来一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, everyone, let's reset and go again in five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.82,0:13:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 雨声？- 嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yusheng? - Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.41,0:13:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 小兄弟 你是最棒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, little bro. You'll be great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.77,0:13:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到在这里见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't expect to see you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.31,0:13:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你的工作比我忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your job keeps you busier than I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.25,0:13:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到当一个安全专家很花时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knew being a security specialist was so time-consuming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.67,0:13:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,下周我要去澳门出差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a job next week in Macao.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.67,0:13:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,真好 那我们离得近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you were in the neighborhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.89,0:13:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 秦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's great to see you, Chin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.43,0:13:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,希望我对你弟弟也能这样打招呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could say the same thing about your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:13:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我能帮你做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can I help you with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.43,0:14:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,雨声有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yusheng is in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.56,0:14:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是不是天才 他都满不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genius or not, he's careless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.81,0:14:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很多人想让他死 - 谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lot of people want to see him die. - Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.32,0:14:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我最担心的是一家叫拉什科的公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A company called Ruscho is who I'm most worried about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.53,0:14:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是家科技巨头 总部位于日内瓦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're a tech giant headquartered in Geneva,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.80,0:14:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他们已经三次提出控股收购雨声 他都拒绝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they tried to buy Yusheng out three times already, and he's refused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这些家伙可不是甘心被拒绝的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are not the kind of guys who take no for an answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他这个周末要去曼谷参加单身派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to Bangkok this weekend for a bachelor party,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他不愿带保镖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he won't take a bodyguard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.09,0:14:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你付钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll pay you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.43,0:14:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一家人 没必要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are family. Not necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.05,0:15:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 表弟 我送你回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Party's over. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,大哥 陪我再玩一会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这个地方不安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not safe here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.18,0:15:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,走啦 表弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm taking you home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.17,0:16:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我是"伽利略" 你是囚犯1764号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Galileo. You are inmate 1764.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.84,0:16:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 你是囚犯1764号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, you are inmate 1764.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.84,0:16:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到哈迪斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Hades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.71,0:17:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,囚犯1764号请注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention, inmate 1764.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.22,0:17:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你被指派参加竞技区搏斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have been reported to battle in the zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.70,0:17:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,搏斗开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Begin battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.55,0:18:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,搏斗结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The battle is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.18,0:18:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,囚犯1764号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inmate 1764,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你赢得两小时的庇护时光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have earned two hours of sanctuary time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.87,0:18:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,其他囚犯请返回各自囚室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All remaining inmates return to your spoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.83,0:18:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.77,0:18:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所有囚犯请返回各自囚室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All prisoners return to your spoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.83,0:18:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们肯定能找到可以说话的人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There must be someone we could talk to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.37,0:18:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,把我们带出去 我没做错什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to get us out of here. I didn't do anything wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.04,0:18:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我没做错什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't do anything wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.97,0:18:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,囚犯1764号 去安全屋报到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inmate 1764, report to the sanctuary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.94,0:18:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.00,0:18:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是赢家要去的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must be where the winners go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.41,0:19:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,树失踪了 法律上的失踪 你那里有什么消息？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shu's gone. This is legit. What do you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.38,0:19:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他表姐说她找他们十八小时了 运气不佳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His cousin says she's been trying them both for 18 hours. No luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.95,0:19:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 派对是周六晚上 - 从派对上有没有收获？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Party happened Saturday night. - What'd you get from the party?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.70,0:19:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没有安保录像 什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No security tapes, nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.37,0:19:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我来跟进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I'll look into it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.42,0:19:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,所有囚犯返回各自囚室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All prisoners return to your spoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.79,0:19:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所有囚犯返回各自囚室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All prisoners return to your spoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.50,0:20:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,在监狱里 他们首先要做的就是摧毁你的精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first thing they try to do in lockup is break your spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.91,0:20:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,绝不允许发生那样的事 你必须在心理上保持强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't allow that to happen. You have to stay mentally strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.35,0:20:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,成功越狱需要关注三个关键因素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to focus on three key things to a successful breakout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.43,0:20:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,哪三个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.52,0:20:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一 了解布局结构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, know the layout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.88,0:20:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,二 熟悉日常规律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two, understand the routine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.55,0:20:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,三 有内部或外部的支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three, have help from the inside or out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.38,0:20:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,准确来说就是团队合作 你的最爱 我可以断定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Teamwork. Exactly. Your favorite one, I can tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,千万记住 树 团队行动 所有的一切都是一个整体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, Shu, you move together. Everything flows as one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.43,0:21:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,一七六四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, seven, six, four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.91,0:21:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你是监狱长？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you the warden?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.59,0:21:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你表弟很有才气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your cousin is a brilliant man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.23,0:21:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他给我说了他专利的细节 34ACJL号专利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave me the details of his patent, number 34ACJL.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.86,0:22:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有说36BBBCK号专利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not number 36BBBCK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你去说服他把专利卖给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to convince him to give that to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.93,0:22:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要那样做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.51,0:22:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你们一起长大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You grew up together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.02,0:22:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,像亲兄弟一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.59,0:22:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但你们不是亲兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you weren't brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.01,0:22:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,一场家庭悲剧让你不得不和他一起生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A family tragedy forced you to live with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.93,0:22:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你恨雨声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hated Yusheng.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.68,0:22:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么总是比别人聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How he was always smarter than everyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.29,0:22:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他本可以帮助很多人 可他只顾自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He could've helped a lot of people, but he went for himself instead,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.63,0:22:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他有钱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he got rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.27,0:22:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 他对金钱的迷恋…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, his love of money...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.50,0:22:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他的宝贵专利…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his precious patent...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.82,0:22:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,会让你送命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is going to get you killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.04,0:22:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我对我的囚犯了如指掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know everything about my animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.83,0:22:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,想知道我是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to know who I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.95,0:22:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我是动物园管理员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the Zookeeper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.17,0:22:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,所有囚犯在竞技区报到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All prisoners report to the zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.17,0:22:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所有囚犯在竞技区报到 - 你跟他说了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All prisoners report to the zoo. - What did you tell him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.05,0:22:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.53,0:23:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你交出了第一个专利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave up the first patent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.52,0:23:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎样？他们折磨我 那个专利不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So? They were torturing me. That one's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.77,0:23:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他清楚我们的背景 - 我没告诉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He knew things about our background. - I didn't tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.15,0:23:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,第二个专利 是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The second patent, what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.65,0:23:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,高级立方星技术 游戏规则颠覆者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Advanced cube satellite tech. It's a game changer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.62,0:23:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,它能越权控制全球任何一台计算机系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can override and control any computer system in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.93,0:23:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就像一把网络万能钥匙 但也不是你想象的那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a cyber skeleton key. And it's not what you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.87,0:23:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这无关金钱 我申请了专利就为的是埋葬它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't about money. I patented it so I could bury it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.44,0:23:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,落到了坏人的手里 游戏就结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the wrong hands, game over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.34,0:23:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,防御系统 核弹程式 没人能够置身事外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Defense systems, nuclear codes. No one will be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.06,0:23:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,金布拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kimbral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.49,0:23:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.19,0:24:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是每天都要搏斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not every day is a fight day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.53,0:24:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.91,0:24:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我是他表弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm his cousin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.62,0:24:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们俩出现在这里绝对不是巧合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think it's a coincidence that we both are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.54,0:24:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我想他们是在寻找布雷斯林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they're after Breslin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.17,0:24:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道 干了这么长时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, after spending a lot of time with this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.80,0:24:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我把耳朵贴在地面上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put my ear to the ground,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.88,0:24:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢我看到的 我不喜欢我听到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just didn't like what I saw, didn't like what I heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.17,0:24:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你到这多久了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long have you been here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.05,0:24:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,很难说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hard to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.89,0:24:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜… 大概有几个月了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My best guess is... couple of months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.77,0:24:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么地方？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.73,0:24:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,有很多谣传 跟神话一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a lot of rumors, like mythology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.64,0:24:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这个叫高价值资产监禁服务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called the High Asset Detention Service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.90,0:24:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,哈迪斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.73,0:24:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,希腊神话？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greek mythology?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.15,0:24:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,冥王府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Land of the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.56,0:24:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是谁都有进无出 就这么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever goes in just doesn't come out. It's that simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.17,0:24:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听起来很熟悉 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sounds familiar. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.82,0:24:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,据说"坟墓"背后的人会遭受毒打 经过调整\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The word is the people behind the Tomb took a beating, did some adjustments,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.23,0:24:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回来会更强大 - 这些可恶的家伙都是什么人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-and then came back strong. - Who are these assholes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.70,0:24:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,间谍 罪犯 商人 官员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spies, criminals, businessmen, elected officials.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.71,0:24:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,利益 巨大利益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Profit. Big profit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.17,0:25:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么会认为他在那儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you think he's there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.38,0:25:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他的表弟雨声被列在了竞争对手的暗杀名单上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His cousin Yusheng was put on some kind of hit list by his competition,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.89,0:25:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,一家叫拉什科的卫星技术公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a satellite tech company called Ruscho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.80,0:25:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,有搏斗日 也有休战日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's battle days and there's truce days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.03,0:25:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能赢得搏斗 你就有福利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you win a battle, you get benefits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.11,0:25:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你搏斗失败 或拒绝搏斗…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you lose or refuse to fight...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.85,0:25:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里的日子就不会好过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your time in here is very uncomfortable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.22,0:25:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是他们把这里叫"动物园"的原因 我们都是园里的动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why they call it "the zoo." We're all animals here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.63,0:25:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,适者生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Survival of the fittest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.94,0:25:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们特别想让某人消失 为什么不直接杀了他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want someone to disappear so bad, why not just kill them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.58,0:25:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,如果那样 全世界都会知道他们死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because then the world will know they are dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.64,0:25:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿 他们只是消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, they are just gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.20,0:25:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们应该进去救他们出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we got to go in, get them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.45,0:25:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不能盲目进入 我们不了解布局结构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't go in there blind. We don't know a layout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.54,0:25:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们什么都不了解 - 你一无所知时也曾闯过"坟墓"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We don't have anything. - You broke the Tomb totally blind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.94,0:25:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 不过 那是我运气好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I got lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.20,0:25:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们甚至都不肯定树是否就在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't even know for sure if Shu's there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.80,0:25:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 如果他在那儿呢？- 听着 如果他在那里 我们会救他出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And what if he is? - Look, if he's there, we'll get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.26,0:25:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,如果盲目进去 我们自己也会被困\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We go in there blind, we get trapped ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.69,0:25:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我处理不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think I can handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.72,0:25:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,它比我们任何一个人都强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is bigger than any one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.81,0:25:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.82,0:26:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 出现数据外泄 有人侵入我们的系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, we've got a data breach. Someone's in our system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.31,0:26:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.14,0:26:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,关闭系统 马上关闭系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut it down. Shut it down now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.50,0:26:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,在为晚上扫清障碍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just cleaning up for the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.20,0:26:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我在拉什科的唯一联络人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the only contact I got at Ruscho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.51,0:26:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道他会不会跟你说话 但总归是个不错的切入点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not sure if he'll talk to you, but it's a good place to start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.70,0:26:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,就一张便利贴？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A sticky note?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.93,0:26:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有什么消息？- 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So what do you got? - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.54,0:26:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,两样东西 一个神秘的银行帐户 代码麻雀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two things. A dark bank account, code-named Sparrow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.98,0:26:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,拉什科持续给这个帐户汇款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ruscho's been sending money to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.77,0:26:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他们给利昂·格拉西汇了一千万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they also sent ten million to Leon Grassi,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.08,0:26:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,私营监狱产业的说客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a lobbyist for the private prison industry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.67,0:27:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这个利昂·格拉西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this Leon Grassi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.26,0:27:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他曾为监狱局工作了十三年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He used to work for the prison board for about 13 years,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.49,0:27:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,每次我从他的地盘脱逃出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then he started taking a lot of heat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.95,0:27:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他会受到很多批评\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every time I broke out of one of his places,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.95,0:27:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,因此他决定跳槽到私人监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so he decided to jump into the private sector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.87,0:27:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,自那以后再没他的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haven't heard from him since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.19,0:27:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,今天你看上去很漂亮 其实你自己知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look very nice today, but you know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.43,0:27:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,给你拿杯喝的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get you a drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.23,0:27:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不喝你这里卖的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not what you got, Tiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.94,0:27:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你不会就这样改过自新 干一份不错的酒保工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you didn't go straight and get an honest job pouring drinks,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.98,0:27:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 德罗沙 你在这干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so tell me, DeRosa, what are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.04,0:27:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我也可以问你一样的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could easily ask you the same question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.89,0:27:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 当然 这是私人问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, that's personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.66,0:27:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,接到阿比盖尔的电话 这是第一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a call from Abigail, this being the first time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.15,0:27:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,办公室你坐了这么久 又重返战场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're back in the field after being a desk jockey for so long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.29,0:28:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她以为你都快生锈了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She thought you might be a little rusty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.71,0:28:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好伤人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that hurts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.75,0:28:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.01,0:28:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你也认识那个家伙？- 你是说那个自封的大佬？不认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Know that guy as well? - You mean the wannabe gangster? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.37,0:28:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你认出他了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You recognize him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.02,0:28:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要给你引荐一下？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want me to introduce you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.52,0:28:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,从什么时候开始你和阿比盖尔联系这么紧密？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since when are you so tight with Abigail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.81,0:28:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,如你所说 这是私人问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you said, it's personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.23,0:28:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么样 里昂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing, Leon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.48,0:28:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,里昂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.99,0:28:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 我的一个手下失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, one of my men is missing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.80,0:28:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他是在一座叫哈迪斯的秘密监狱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I think he's in a black-site prison called Hades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.88,0:28:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有想起是哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ring a bell anywhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.78,0:28:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一家叫做拉什科的公司 欧洲卫星技术公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's this company called Ruscho. European satellite tech company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.97,0:28:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他们给你一千万美元 这听起来怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They gave you about ten million bucks. How about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.94,0:28:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,一千万美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten million dollars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.54,0:28:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一大笔钱 但我认为这都是胡扯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lot of money. But I think it's all bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.59,0:28:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你不是为卫星技术公司当说客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you don't lobby for satellite tech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.77,0:28:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 雷…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Ray...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.43,0:28:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你是为了利益替秘密监狱当说客 我说的对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lobby for black-site prison profit, am I right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.36,0:28:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听着 雷… - 你得告诉我你知道的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look, Ray... - You're gonna tell me what you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.03,0:29:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.25,0:29:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 布雷斯林…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Breslin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.93,0:29:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,重操旧业 感觉好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to be back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.92,0:29:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不 重操旧业实在糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's bad to be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.60,0:29:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 里昂 你在替谁卖命？- 对不起 雷 我不能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Leon, who you working for? - l'm sorry, Ray. I can't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.86,0:29:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,快走吧 想要份工作吗 德罗沙？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Want a job, DeRosa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.95,0:29:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,操 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck,yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.12,0:29:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个私人银行帐户 我需要找人鉴定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's this private bank account, and I need it identified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.34,0:29:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他死了 这是我们的唯一线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With him dead, it's our only lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.33,0:29:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 给我一天时间 我来搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Give me a day, I'll figure it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.57,0:30:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.11,0:30:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪里来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you coming from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.92,0:30:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我在监狱上班 我是厨师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work for the prison. I'm the cook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.74,0:30:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,给我说说厨房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about the kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.08,0:30:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.38,0:30:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,从你的囚室怎么能到厨房？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I get there from your cell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.34,0:30:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.12,0:30:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.73,0:31:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你在动物园里站错了队 我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are on the wrong side of the zoo, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.20,0:31:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我需要你揍我一顿 - 什么？今天是休战日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I need you to kick my ass. - What? It's a truce day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.17,0:31:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,再来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.90,0:32:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你究竟要干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you up to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.53,0:32:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,以为能说通医生 给我们搞些福利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought I could work the doctor, get us some benefits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.08,0:32:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,结果发现医生是个灯柱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turns out the doctor is a lamp stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.41,0:32:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫阿卡拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Akala.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.92,0:32:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.22,0:33:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 他把所有的点联系了起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - He connected the dots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.14,0:33:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你在拉什科的内线送我一个兔子洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your inside man at Ruscho sent me down a rabbit hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.14,0:33:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来我已经找到了 能带我找到树的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it looks like I found a guy who can lead us to Shu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.27,0:33:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.21,0:33:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,现在吗？他在开车我在追\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now? Driving the car I'm chasing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.50,0:33:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,相信你知道你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure hope you know what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.82,0:33:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,稍后打给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.66,0:34:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你躲哪儿去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you hiding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.83,0:34:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.00,0:34:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.14,0:34:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,囚犯1764号 1765号 请在竞技区报到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inmates 1764 and 1765, report to the zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.27,0:34:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 在竞技区报到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, report to the zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.65,0:34:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他们昨晚又折磨我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They tortured me again last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.66,0:34:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,小时候你心理上就比我坚强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were always mentally tougher than me as a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.05,0:34:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,记得吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.23,0:34:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在需要坚强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to be now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.81,0:35:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,开始搏斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Begin battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.93,0:35:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,搏斗结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Battle is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.14,0:35:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,囚犯1764号 1765号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inmates 1764, 1765,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.65,0:36:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你们赢得了两小时的庇护时光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've earned two hours of sanctuary time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.03,0:36:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,负面框架理论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative skeleton theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.57,0:36:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,利用他们让你所见去绘制不可见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use what they let you see to map out what you can't see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.99,0:36:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这样布局结构才能呈现于你面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how the layout begins to reveal itself to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.84,0:36:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,锻炼你的思维 来穿越限制你的实体围墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Train your mind to look beyond the physical wall that confines you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.04,0:36:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,囚室另一边是完全不同的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a whole separate world on the other side of the cells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.27,0:36:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,走廊 审讯室 医务室 厨房 指挥部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hallways, interrogation, infirmary, kitchen, HQ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.03,0:36:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,而现在 全部都是负空间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now, it's all negative space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.20,0:36:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,用不了多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not for long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.62,0:36:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我会救大家出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get us out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.21,0:37:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.38,0:37:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,快点啊 卢克 你在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Luke. Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.25,0:37:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这是卢克手机上拨出的最后一个号码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the last number Luke called on his cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.31,0:37:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,日内瓦 拉什科？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ruscho Geneva?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.60,0:37:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,要我叫哈什进来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should I get Hush in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.45,0:37:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.65,0:37:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 有人曾经告诉我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, someone once told me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.61,0:37:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,破解最难的谜题时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the single most important thing to remember{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.32,0:37:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,必须记住的最重要一点是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in solving the hardest riddles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.29,0:37:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这些谜题是专门设计来骗你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that they're designed to trick you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.62,0:37:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,推翻你自己的假设\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subvert against your own assumptions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.58,0:37:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我的假设告诉我 你不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my assumptions are telling me that there's no way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.07,0:37:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,让卢克直接违背公司原则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you would let Luke go directly against company order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.42,0:37:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 他只是想出外勤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, he just wanted to do the legwork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.07,0:37:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他独领风潮的良好机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought it was a good chance for him to take the lead on something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.96,0:37:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,可现在卢克和树都失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now Luke and Shu are missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.20,0:38:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你是囚犯1924号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are prisoner 1924.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.47,0:38:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 你是囚犯1924号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, you are prisoner 1924.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.94,0:38:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到哈迪斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Hades{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.46,0:38:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 事情有了眉目 我侵入了他们系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I felt something was going on. I hacked into the system,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.14,0:38:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说 卢克是想去日内瓦找拉什科公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and basically, Luke tried to meet up with Ruscho Geneva.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.67,0:38:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.93,0:38:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉他远离那些家伙 他怎么会卷入进去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told him to stay away from these guys. How'd he get involved with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.22,0:38:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.85,0:38:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我给了他 我的一个线人的信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave him one of my contacts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.22,0:38:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.57,0:38:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,在你失踪后 布雷斯林开始到处找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After you went missing, Breslin started digging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.19,0:38:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他认为这地方是"坟墓"幕后的同一伙人所建\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He thinks this place was started by the same people behind the Tomb,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.51,0:38:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.94,0:39:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我搞砸了 最终被困这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I screwed up. Ended up in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.23,0:39:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 我快搞清布局结构了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't matter. I'm close to getting the layout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.33,0:39:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 需要我做什么？- 现在不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you want me to do? - Nothing yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.94,0:39:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们越少接触越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The less contact we have, the better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.72,0:39:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,树 这不可能是巧合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shu, it can't be a coincidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.34,0:39:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,现在布雷斯林的三个专家都被关在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that all three of Breslings specialists are locked up here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.63,0:39:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不可能是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.81,0:39:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,可能他们正在观察我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assume they are watching us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.65,0:39:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.75,0:39:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他快要把专利交给你们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's close to giving it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.30,0:39:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,快要？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.25,0:39:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他坚持不了多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.67,0:39:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那他就该交出我想要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then he needs to give me what I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.77,0:39:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我把他喂给其它动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or I'll feed him to the rest of the animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.21,0:40:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我小时候就想学做汤饺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've tried to make soup dumplings since I was a kid,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.51,0:40:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但每次都是面团和得太硬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but every time, the dough is too stiff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.29,0:40:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我不知道你们的交易是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I don't know what your deal is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.99,0:40:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但是… 我不想死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but... I don't want to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.20,0:40:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他们对你的所做所为都是错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What they are doing to you is wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.76,0:40:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来帮你回家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then let me help you get home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.56,0:40:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,从我的囚室去厨房的时候 他们会蒙上我的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They blindfold me when I go from my cell to the kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.85,0:40:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是观察事物的唯一途径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not the only way to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.38,0:40:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,十六 十七 十八 十九 二十\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}16,17,18,19,20...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.35,0:40:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,多少步？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many steps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.44,0:40:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,24步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty-four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.07,0:40:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,每座监狱送给你的一份礼物就是时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one gift every prison gives you is time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.82,0:41:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,别浪费了这份厚礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't waste it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.28,0:41:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,利用每次机会设想布局结构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Visualize the layout every chance you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.87,0:41:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,今天早上是45步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was 45 this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.00,0:41:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.24,0:41:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,到厨房的步数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steps to the kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.92,0:41:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,距离翻倍了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The distance doubled?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.17,0:41:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.30,0:41:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要去安全屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to get in the sanctuary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.37,0:41:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 我还想要瓶可乐呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and I need a Coke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.43,0:41:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweet dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.04,0:41:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,所有囚犯返回各自囚室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All prisoners return to your spoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.95,0:41:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 所有囚犯返回各自囚室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, all prisoners return to your spoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.51,0:42:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,即使最复杂的故事通常也都基于一个简单的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even the most complex of narratives are often based on one simple idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.05,0:42:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,答案很可能就在你的面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answer is most likely right in front of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.05,0:42:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,监狱能移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The prison is moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.11,0:43:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,囚室到竞技区的入口会改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cell spokes change entry points to the zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.52,0:43:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,像魔方一样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a Rubik's Cube?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.33,0:43:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不了解日常规律 我们不清楚布局结构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got no routine. We got no layout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.36,0:43:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我们没有支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we have no help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.49,0:43:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们有支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.73,0:43:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,新纳粹？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neo-Nazis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.96,0:43:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,计算机奇才 他们是前些日子被抓来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer nerds. They brought them in some time back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.96,0:43:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们被集中在冰岛的某个地下室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They rounded them up in some random basement in Iceland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.21,0:43:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们自称"死亡军团"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They call themselves The Legion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.96,0:43:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,领袖的名号是"倒计时"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The leader's handle is Count Zero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.06,0:43:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他敲诈了"财富"杂志500家公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's screwed with more Fortune 500 companies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.42,0:43:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你我都说不上名字的公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than you and I can name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.11,0:43:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们的管理员有个麻烦事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But our zookeeper's got a problem{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.64,0:43:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他不知道哪一个是真的"倒计时"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because he doesn't know which one is actually Count Zero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.74,0:43:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他日夜审讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's interrogated them day and night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.86,0:43:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,从未赢得过庇护时光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sanctuary time ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.07,0:43:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,监狱为什么要在乎这个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does the prison care?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.84,0:43:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,因为"倒计时"获得了监狱的规格参数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because Count Zero has acquired the specs to the prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.16,0:43:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他们想知道他是谁 服务器在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need to know who he is and where his servers are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.54,0:44:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 监狱的规格参数？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Specs of the prison? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.67,0:44:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能赶在监狱之前找出谁是"倒计时"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you can find out which one is Count Zero before the prison...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.85,0:44:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,或许他能帮助我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe he can help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.08,0:44:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我要见"臭虫"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to see Bug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.05,0:44:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我要见… "臭虫"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to see... Bug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.84,0:44:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想买昆虫之类的书 书在楼上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want a book on insects, they're upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.06,0:45:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 就在这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Right this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.74,0:45:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,"臭虫"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.40,0:45:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,德罗沙？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DeRosa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.23,0:45:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,麻雀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.08,0:45:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他是谁？- 别问了 我不会告诉你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who is he? - Come on. I can't give that to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.86,0:45:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,昆虫世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Insect Society{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.75,0:45:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 客户永远匿名 - 客户永远匿名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-clients remain anonymous. - Clients remain anonymous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.22,0:46:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 特别是… - 闭嘴 "臭虫"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Above all else... - Shut up, Bug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.27,0:46:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们哥们一起好多年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been boys for a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.38,0:46:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你们在这里所做的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love what you guys do here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.94,0:46:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 "臭虫"…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Bug...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.11,0:46:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你还不跟我开口说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm gonna have to kick the shit out of you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.87,0:46:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我会打得你屁滚尿流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you don't start talking to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.92,0:46:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我会告诉你一个名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get you a name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.60,0:46:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.52,0:46:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我还想再要一样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna need one more thing from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.51,0:47:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,雨声快放弃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yusheng's close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.84,0:47:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time is up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.05,0:47:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你在逼他放弃他一生的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're asking him to give up his life's work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.84,0:47:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们大家都知道根本不是这么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We both know that that's not what this is about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.01,0:47:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你很清楚那项技术能做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know exactly what that tech can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.85,0:47:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time is up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.43,0:47:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.47,0:47:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,搏斗结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Battle is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.75,0:47:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,囚犯1789号 3486号 6412号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inmates 1789, 3486, 6412{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.74,0:47:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你们赢得了两小时的庇护时光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've earned two hours of sanctuary time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.88,0:47:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你们的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.10,0:48:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你们其中一人知道这个地方的布局结构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of you knows the layout of this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.58,0:48:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 安全屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. The sanctuary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.29,0:48:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们进去过吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever been in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.17,0:48:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,给我布局结构 我能让你们进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that layout, I can get you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.68,0:48:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是死亡军团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are Legion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.89,0:49:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是死亡军团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are Legion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.64,0:50:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"倒计时"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Count Zero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.70,0:50:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们告诉我布局的逻辑 我就能把大家救出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you give me the logic of the layout, I can get us out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.65,0:51:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是怎么知道的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did they know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.82,0:51:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,金布拉总想要抢你的风头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kimbral was trying to upstage you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.92,0:51:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉了我所有事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.04,0:51:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你是监狱的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You work for the prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.55,0:51:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我管理着这座监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I run the prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.08,0:52:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,贾斯珀·金布拉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Jasper Kimbral?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.09,0:52:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.50,0:52:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,从他离开这儿起 你跟踪他的足迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to follow the footprints from the time he left this place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.05,0:52:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,到他目前所在的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to wherever he is now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.88,0:52:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,哈迪斯肯定在某个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hades has got to be somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.88,0:52:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 地下世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, the underworld.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.07,0:52:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,阿比盖尔 能让我们单独待一会吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abigail, can you give us a minute?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.71,0:52:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.70,0:52:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们之间看法不同 但我愿意听你的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know we've had our differences, but I got to hear it from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.46,0:52:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,向我发誓我们之间没有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swear to me we're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.88,0:52:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么 伙计？我们之间当然没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about, man? Of course we're good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.46,0:52:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.64,0:52:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,而且入侵计算机你给的钱也不少 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're still paying me good money to hack shit, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.52,0:52:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要乱来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I mess that up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.64,0:52:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你关起门来都在干些什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what've you been working on behind closed doors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.63,0:52:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这样说吧 我正在干一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just say I'm working on something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.61,0:52:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,能够改善我们之间沟通的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that will improve the communications between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.41,0:52:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊 树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Shu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.98,0:53:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经见过我们的动物园管理员了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've met my Zookeeper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.42,0:53:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无法击破他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We couldn't break 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.23,0:53:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真是了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Extraordinary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.60,0:53:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,三个人 都不愿意互相背叛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three men, and they wouldn't turn on one another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.62,0:53:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,可是你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.19,0:53:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你让他们站在你这一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've got them on your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.49,0:53:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你让他们都相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got them to trust you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.45,0:53:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我期待了很长时间想在你脸上看到那种表情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've waited a long time to see that look on your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.29,0:53:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,看看谁在这里 是卢克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look who's here. It's Lukey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.57,0:53:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,快说说 难道你们俩相互见面不开心吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, come on. Aren't you guys happy to see each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.58,0:54:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,当这个地方的投资人发现雷·布雷斯林的门徒们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the investors of this place found out that Ray Breslings protege{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.45,0:54:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,被解除了关系 你们可以想象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had been cut loose, you can imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.11,0:54:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,布雷斯林让他们的最近一次投资损失了大把银子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breslin cost them a lot of money on their last investment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.88,0:54:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人不喜欢血本无归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These people do not like losing money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.03,0:54:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他们需要一个更好的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They needed someone better...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.70,0:54:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,更现代的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}more current,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.69,0:54:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,所以… 瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so... voila.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.66,0:54:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到哈迪斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Hades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.00,0:54:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你是为了复仇才把我们关在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, we're here because you want your revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.34,0:54:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.95,0:54:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,坚定 彻底 明确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unwavering, complete and definitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.70,0:54:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吧 动物园里的每个人对我来说都是财富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, everyone in this zoo is worth money to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.64,0:54:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们拥有的信息总能让外面的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They all have information that someone out there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.98,0:54:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,开出百万美元的价格…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thinks is worth millions of dollars...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.79,0:54:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是你的表弟雨声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}especially your cousin Yusheng.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.17,0:54:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.42,0:54:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你们对我一文不值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're worth nothing to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.06,0:55:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那为什么不杀了我们做个了断？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why don't you kill us and get it over with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.76,0:55:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你的战斗精神在哪 卢克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your fighting spirit at, Luke? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.75,0:55:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,设计这种地方就是给你希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place is designed to give you hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.71,0:55:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,赢得搏斗 你就获得福利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You win a battle, you get benefits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.98,0:55:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,读读书 作作画\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Read a book. Make art.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.51,0:55:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,搏斗失败 你就饿肚子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lose a battle, then you lose food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.51,0:55:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,开始怀疑自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start to doubt yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.71,0:55:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你确立目标 死而复生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you set goals, and you rise again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.58,0:55:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,人类本性的所有戏剧性都在这里有所体现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the drama of the human condition is represented right here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.16,0:55:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,就体现在我的动物园里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in my zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.27,0:55:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我要保证你们俩忙个不停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna make sure that you two have plenty to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.56,0:55:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,等你们醒过来的时候 你们就成了出卖"倒计时"的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you wake up, you'll be the men who sold out Count Zero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.28,0:55:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那能给你一种了解人类本性的独特视觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That should give you a unique perspective on the human condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.68,0:55:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,囚犯1764号 在竞技区参加搏斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inmate 1764, report for battle in the zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.18,0:55:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,囚犯1924号 在竞技区参加搏斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inmate 1924, report for battle in the zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.78,0:56:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,搏斗开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Begin battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.47,0:57:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他在这里一天 就要确保他每天参加搏斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he's in the zoo, make sure he fights every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.17,0:57:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,树不再有休战日了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no more truce days for Shu...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.80,0:57:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,直到他的意志被摧毁 让我们拿到雨声的技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until his will is broken and we have Yusheng's technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.35,0:57:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你没有布局结构 没有日常规律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you have no layout. There is no routine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.75,0:57:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you have no help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.66,0:57:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但凡事必有备用计划 即使是对付这些混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's always a plan B, even for these assholes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.13,0:58:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们想方设法使这个地方看上去完全自动化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They try to make this place look totally automated,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.38,0:58:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们还是能看到人类警卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you saw those human guards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.51,0:58:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是他们的备用计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's their plan B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.15,0:58:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你的呢 树？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is yours, Shu?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.24,0:58:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.87,0:58:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,金布拉 进展汇报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kimbral, report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.54,0:58:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们比以前更接近摧毁雨声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're closer than ever to breaking Yusheng.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.46,0:58:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,接近？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Closer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.79,0:58:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 等你摧毁的时候再汇报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, report back when you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.67,0:58:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,集中更多精力获取专利而不是复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Focus more on getting that patent than your revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.63,0:58:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,带他来这里就是冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a risk bringing him here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.30,0:58:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他能打过那些机器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He beat their last facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.06,0:58:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我要给他们看看 他打不过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna show them he can't beat mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.87,0:59:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see some hands!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.95,0:59:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们看清你的双手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now! Let's see 'em!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.07,0:59:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,目标已投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target's compliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.77,0:59:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们抓到了他 - 带他进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, we got him. - Bringing him in now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.46,0:59:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,把他锁起来 把他…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock him up, lock him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.95,0:59:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,在此之前一切只存在于理论中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before it was all theoretical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.20,0:59:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,什么样的设计是最好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What design is best,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.85,0:59:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,什么样的策略能对付什么样的防御\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what strategy works against what defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.87,0:59:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,现在这都能得以实现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now it's real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.08,1:00:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你对抗我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You against me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.51,1:00:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, you won.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.64,1:00:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.47,1:00:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾尝试更多的算法 好让机器负责管理行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to go more algorithms, let the machines run the show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.57,1:00:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你说不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.71,1:00:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你大谈人类的直觉 团队合作的价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You talked about human intuition. The value of teamwork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.28,1:00:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,既然你们三个都在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's three of you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.75,1:00:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,演示给我看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.29,1:00:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,所有囚犯在竞技区报到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All prisoners report to the zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.39,1:00:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 所有囚犯在竞技区报到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, all prisoners report to the zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.51,1:00:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,囚犯9051号 在竞技区参加搏斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inmate 9051, report for battle in the zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.25,1:00:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 在竞技区参加搏斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, report for battle in the zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.80,1:01:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,搏斗开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Begin battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.95,1:01:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,搏斗结束 重复 搏斗结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Battle is over. I repeat, battle is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.47,1:02:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你有一条新的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have one new message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.23,1:02:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,德罗沙 我是哈什 他们抓走了布雷斯林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DeRosa, it's Hush. They took Breslin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.79,1:02:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们所有人都在哈迪斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All our guys are in Hades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.90,1:02:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你是唯一能帮助我们脱逃的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the only one that can help us get 'em out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.49,1:02:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,给我回电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.70,1:02:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,树… 你不能放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shu... you can't give up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.84,1:02:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你对放弃又了解多少？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you know about giving up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.47,1:02:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来没有坚持过什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never stood for anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.43,1:03:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,树 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shu, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.71,1:03:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是想赚钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just wanted to be rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.31,1:03:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那有什么错？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.77,1:03:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我家总是没有钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My family never had any money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.02,1:03:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你父母去世后 我们还要替你还债\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when your parents died, we had to pay for you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.45,1:03:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧？你可千万别忘了那些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? Don't you ever forget that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.24,1:03:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,继续 继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead. Go ahead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.07,1:03:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,打我啊 快啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lash out! Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.58,1:03:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,当你无法控制自己的时候 你就是这个样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's what you've always done when you can't control things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.31,1:03:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直是老样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're always the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.63,1:03:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.05,1:03:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.97,1:03:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我总是能让人猜透\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm predictable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.23,1:03:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,金布拉知道我们要做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kimbral knew what we were gonna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.73,1:03:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他在玩弄我的自负\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He played to my arrogance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.00,1:03:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道我会不顾一切救大家出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knew I'd take it upon myself to get us out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.41,1:03:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他把我们玩弄于股掌之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He played us perfectly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.24,1:04:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么才能反击他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we play him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.99,1:04:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,备用计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plan B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.00,1:04:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要让他没法猜透\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We stop being so predictable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.58,1:04:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我准备开口了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ready to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.70,1:04:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,技术细节很复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tech details are complex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.54,1:04:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我会按步骤告诉你们细节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will give them to you in stages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.93,1:04:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我所有细节 否则免谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me everything,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.20,1:04:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们连上了 - 雷 你能听到我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're in. - Ray, you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.36,1:04:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我听得很清楚 - 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can hear you clearly. - Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.70,1:04:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,谁能想到你的业余牙医技术还能起作用？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knew your amateur dentist skills would pay off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.71,1:04:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你们满意我上班时间待在游戏室了吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now aren't you glad I spent all of those company hours in my playroom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.00,1:04:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有什么消息？- 我连续熬夜三个晚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you got? - I been up for three nights straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.98,1:04:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,密码破解器挖到宝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Password breaker hit the motherlode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.73,1:04:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经突破了防火墙进入了伽利略主机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm through the firewall and into the Galileo mainframe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.03,1:04:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,正在接收哈迪斯所有系统的数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Receiving good reads from all systems at Hades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.27,1:05:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我最好的定位系统蜘蛛正在超时工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My best GPS spiders are working overtime,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.46,1:05:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在只得到33%的布局结构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we only have 33% of the layout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.10,1:05:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,没有适合你们的撤退方案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No exact exit strategy for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.97,1:05:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要内部的一个接入点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need an access point from the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.48,1:05:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要去找雨声帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to get Yusheng to work on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.78,1:05:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被全天侯监控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got eyes on us 24/7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.36,1:05:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能干掉摄像头吗？- 可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you get the cameras? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.36,1:05:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我只能保证一分钟 - 70秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can guarantee a minute. - Seventy seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.71,1:05:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,或许70秒 但在那之后 他们就知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe 70 seconds, but after that, it's gonna know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.04,1:05:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.91,1:05:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一件事需要你去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's one more thing I want you to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.18,1:05:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你能控制伽利略的语音盒子吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you get access to Galileo's voice box?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.85,1:05:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是个集体 要动大伙一块动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's move together. Flow as one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.08,1:05:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那个音箱出什么问题了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with the boom box?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.51,1:05:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是个集体 要动大伙一块动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's move together. Flow as one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.31,1:05:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那是青岛话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Qingdao{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.77,1:05:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,48号到58号摄像头覆盖B区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cameras 48 through 58 cover spoke B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.73,1:05:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们用30秒就能清除摄像头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can clear it in 30 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.31,1:06:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.02,1:06:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,68秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sixty-eight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.92,1:06:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,66秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sixty-six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.20,1:06:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你到头来还是学会了我的语言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You managed to learn my language after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.22,1:06:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只有70秒时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We only got about 70 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.62,1:06:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,哈什正在获取关键数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hush is trying to get the critical data,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.59,1:06:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但到目前为止他只拿到了33%的布局结构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he's only got 33% of the layout so far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.50,1:06:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没有发现到出口的直接路径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No direct paths to the exits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.69,1:06:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他侵入了伽利略？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's hacking Galileo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.82,1:06:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 他需要我们支援 - 不到40秒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Affirmative. He's gonna need our help. - Less than 40 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.06,1:06:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一种倒像设计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is an inverted design{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.79,1:06:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,可以保护中心区域和控制室不受外界的破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that protects the center and control rooms from the outside in,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.91,1:06:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,因此才很难从外面攻破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's what makes it so difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.17,1:06:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须从内部给他一个物理接入点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to give him a physical access point from the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.25,1:06:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉雨声 让他搞定这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk to Yusheng. Get him to work on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.41,1:06:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,只有10秒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten seconds. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.29,1:06:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,有点耐心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just be patient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.68,1:06:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说在铁路附近的仓库里还有飞车追逐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard that a car chase went down at the warehouse complex near the rail yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.50,1:07:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,其中一辆车是卢克的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the cars was Luke's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.76,1:07:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,过去检查一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going down there to check it out.{\r}
