Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.27,1:07:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 布雷斯林和同伴正从里面想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Breslin and the guys are working from the inside{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.69,1:07:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,借助仪器帮助我们定位哈迪斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on a device that will help us locate Hades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.16,1:07:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.02,1:07:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到这些人 我要进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You find these guys, I want in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.44,1:07:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们再联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be in touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.54,1:07:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,囚室里我们能相信的人都参加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guys we can trust in most of the spokes are in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.14,1:07:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,一切就绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.77,1:07:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,管理员拿到了参数 不管他把这些参数给谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Zookeeper has the specs. Only a matter of time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.90,1:07:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他们很快会发现参数无效 这只是时间问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before whoever he's giving them to realizes they won't work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.85,1:07:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你从没想过学围棋吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have never wanted to learn Go.{\r}
