Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.40,1:08:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,围棋里最重要的内容就是耐心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patience is the most important part of this game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.77,1:08:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,听到我说的话了吗？我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you hear what I just said? We got to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.92,1:08:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有人手 但没有出路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have the manpower, but no way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.08,1:08:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在寻找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We keep working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.76,1:08:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不过首先 我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But first, we need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.37,1:08:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你能帮囚犯搞到东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you get stuff for inmates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.21,1:08:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙 否则我就告诉机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a favor, or I tell the machine.{\r}
