Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.31,1:10:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,建立了和内部接入点的联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Connection with inside access point established.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.50,1:10:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,哈迪斯已定位 正在扫描布局结构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hades located. Scanning layout now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.16,1:10:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有了布局结构 也清楚了他们的日常规律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have the layout. We know their routine.{\r}
