Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.41,1:10:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我准备关闭伽利略系统 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm ready to shut Galileo down. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.19,1:10:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的撤退方案非常可靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our exit strategy is solid,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.31,1:10:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但要通过那些人类警卫还得靠运气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you still got to get lucky to get past those human guards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.59,1:10:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,竞技区的每一边都有两扇门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's two maintenance doors on either side of the zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.83,1:10:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,灯光熄灭后 你们有三分钟时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the lights go out, you got three minutes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.45,1:10:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,然后系统会重新启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the system starts waking up again.{\r}
