Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.30,1:11:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,所有系统关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All systems down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.61,1:11:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,时间紧迫 门重新锁上前 我们得用用我们的肌肉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clock's ticking. Time to use those muscles before the doors relock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.61,1:11:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 来吧 推 - 推\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, come on. Push. - Push.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.10,1:12:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我是伽利略 所有系统重新上线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Galileo. All systems online.{\r}
