Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.88,1:12:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,雷·布雷斯林打算破坏哈迪斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ray Breslin is attempting to break Hades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.53,1:12:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让你见识一下监狱有什么能耐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to see how the prison responds.{\r}
