Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.86,1:12:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是死亡军团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are Legion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.11,1:12:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,无所谓了 我们走 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever. Let's go. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.76,1:13:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,掩护他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cover their asses.{\r}
