Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.79,1:14:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,重叠在一起的两层圆形地板 像生日蛋糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two circular floors on top of each other like a birthday cake.{\r}
