Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.77,1:15:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们是死亡军团 - 我们是死亡军团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We are Legion. - We are Legion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.12,1:16:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须同步 数到一 三 二 一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to be in sync. On one. Three, two, one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.38,1:16:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 你知道该做什么 - 是的 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, you know what to do. - Yes. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.15,1:16:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,医疗中心安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Medical secured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.41,1:16:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,金布拉 汇报进展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kimbral, report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.00,1:16:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他是很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's good,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.10,1:16:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我的机器总能获胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but my machine always wins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.47,1:16:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那可不一定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not sure about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.66,1:16:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.54,1:16:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我投降 你抓到我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give up. You got me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.97,1:16:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你们还是在哈迪斯里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're still in Hades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.89,1:17:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦伽利略恢复到全功率 我只要触发自动命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And with Galileo back to his full power, I just triggered his autopilot orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.77,1:17:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哈什正在攻击的所有系统都会关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the systems that Hush was attacking are now closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.30,1:17:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你们将永远走不出这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're never getting out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.41,1:17:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吧 孩子 我要给你奖励分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, kid, I got to give you credit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.24,1:17:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里完成了一项伟大的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did a great job here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.07,1:17:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你建造了一个监狱 看起来似乎…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You built a prison. Looks like it has...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.71,1:17:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,没有弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no weaknesses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.34,1:17:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.10,1:17:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,凡事总有弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is always one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.76,1:18:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.08,1:18:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我是管理员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I am the Zookeeper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.17,1:18:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一位熟人朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have this acquaintance friend of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.27,1:18:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,大个子 他帮了我一个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big guy. And he did me a favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.67,1:19:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我给了他这个帐户 特别的帐户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave him this account number, special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.61,1:19:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我破解不了密码 但他可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't crack the code, but he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.86,1:19:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他追踪到了这笔钱 随之追踪到了帐户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he traced the money, and he traced the account.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.94,1:19:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,麻雀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.57,1:19:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是隐藏在幕后的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're the one who's behind all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.34,1:19:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们制定了计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we made a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.65,1:19:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳能系统错误 太阳能系统温度升高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Solar system failure. Solar system heating up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.29,1:19:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚告诉过你伽利略马上会恢复全功率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just told you Galileo was back to his full power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.30,1:19:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,根本不需要太阳能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't need solar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.71,1:19:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,让它爆炸吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let it blow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.38,1:19:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,发现出口 德罗沙 正如说好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's the opening, DeRosa, as promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.44,1:19:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,雨声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yusheng.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.64,1:19:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不许动 - 趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Freeze! - Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.98,1:20:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.70,1:20:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来要花很长时间才能找到这个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could've been looking for this place for a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.41,1:20:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我会找到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would've found it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.96,1:20:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但从外面突破要困难得多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's a lot tougher breaking in from the outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.56,1:20:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我知道不必那样 因为我了解你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I knew that wasn't gonna happen because I know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.84,1:20:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你是怎么想的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how you think...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.90,1:20:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我也知道你会来找我 你也确实来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I knew you would be coming for me, and you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.96,1:20:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴 因为我喜欢这种工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad, because I like working,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.77,1:20:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,如你所见 从里往外攻破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as you can see, from the inside out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.27,1:20:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,哈迪斯有一个特别 特别 特别软弱的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hades had one very, very, very weak spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.49,1:20:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.75,1:20:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,主门安全漏洞 强行进入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security breach at main door. Forced entry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.43,1:20:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哈迪斯和解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hades compromised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.01,1:21:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,到时间了 我们就此结束吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time. Let's finish it right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.32,1:21:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,停下来 停下来 趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Stop! Get on the ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.74,1:21:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,马上趴下 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the ground now! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.60,1:21:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下 趴到地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down! Down on the ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.01,1:21:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,德罗沙 好久没见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DeRosa, long time no see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.71,1:21:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,外套不错 你的泰迪熊在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice PJs. Where's your fucking teddy bear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.64,1:21:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,囚犯9051号 在竞技区参加搏斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prisoner 9051, report for battle in the zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.88,1:21:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们倒要看看没了那些高科技 你有什么本事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see what you can do without your tech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.14,1:22:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,等我的拳头落在你的脸上 我会折磨死你 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After I put my fist through your face, I'm gonna crucify you, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.64,1:23:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我错过了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd I miss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.83,1:23:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这下我们扯平了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess that makes us even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.50,1:23:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 卢克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks,Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.06,1:23:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.17,1:24:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.53,1:24:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放松 - 他终于来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Relax. - There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.36,1:24:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴你加入我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice of you to join us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.32,1:24:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,过了一段自由时光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had some free time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.82,1:24:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,上车 上车 快上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in, get in, get in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.75,1:24:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,哈什 能听到我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hush, you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.27,1:25:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,听到你的声音太好了 我们以为失去你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to hear you. We thought we lost you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.92,1:25:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,树和雨声安然无恙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shu and Yusheng are safe and sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.00,1:25:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,结果怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.42,1:25:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,备用计划成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plan B actually worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.80,1:25:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,记住 树 智力加上耐心 一切皆有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, Shu, with brains and patience, nothing's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.82,1:25:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有人告诉我我们究竟在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can somebody tell me where the hell we are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.61,1:25:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你要告诉他吗 大个子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to tell him, big guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.92,1:25:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,并不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.73,1:25:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,亚特兰大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Atlanta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.15,1:25:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈不是逗我玩吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you fucking kidding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.73,1:25:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哈迪斯在亚特兰大？怎么可能？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hades is in Atlanta? How is that possible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.17,1:25:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,金布拉 汇报进展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kimbral, come in. Report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.31,1:25:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是金布拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not Kimbral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.08,1:25:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.57,1:25:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我要告诉你一件事 我真的非常讨厌这堆狗屎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I got to tell you something. I'm really getting sick of this shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.59,1:25:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,所以不管你是谁…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So whoever you are...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.11,1:25:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你在哪…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wherever you are...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.49,1:25:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都会找到你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're gonna find you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.02,1:25:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for sure.{\r}
